There's no use trying to reason with them. They don't understand.

1870
01:24:39,640 --> 01:24:40,640
Ken! Ken!

1871
01:24:40,640 --> 01:24:42,640
All right, parents, just run to the side.

1872
01:24:42,640 --> 01:24:44,640
Put on a coat if you're gonna take over the world.

1873
01:24:44,640 --> 01:24:45,640
Is that thing in there?

1874
01:24:45,640 --> 01:24:46,640
Ken, for my sake.

1875
01:24:46,640 --> 01:24:47,640
Don't worry, Mother.

1876
01:24:47,640 --> 01:24:50,640
Edie, Edie, please get away from there. I beg you.

1877
01:24:50,640 --> 01:24:52,640
I can't, Mother. Not yet.

1878
01:24:52,640 --> 01:24:55,640
Why are you siding with Ed against us? We're your parents. We love you.

1879
01:24:55,640 --> 01:24:57,640
Tim, please, for my sake.

1880
01:24:57,640 --> 01:24:59,640
Children, I'm your friend.

1881
01:24:59,640 --> 01:25:00,640
Uncle Baldor.

1882
01:25:00,640 --> 01:25:03,640
I wouldn't ask you to do anything that I didn't feel was necessary.

1883
01:25:03,640 --> 01:25:06,640
Think of your parents, the people at the project.

1884
01:25:06,640 --> 01:25:08,640
Your country may be in terrible danger.

1885
01:25:08,640 --> 01:25:11,640
The Thunderer is useless. I don't believe you know what you've done.

1886
01:25:11,640 --> 01:25:12,640
We know.

1887
01:25:12,640 --> 01:25:14,640
We don't have to yell.

1888
01:25:14,640 --> 01:25:15,640
Children, listen.

1889
01:25:15,640 --> 01:25:19,640
Colonel Manly has a daughter of his own. I have a son.

1890
01:25:19,640 --> 01:25:22,640
We wouldn't ask you to do any more than we'd ask our own children.

1891
01:25:22,640 --> 01:25:26,640
So please get away from that cave and let Colonel Manly and his men go in.

1892
01:25:26,640 --> 01:25:28,640
All right, men. Move them out of there.

1893
01:25:28,640 --> 01:25:30,640
Marlon Brando's dancing.

1894
01:25:30,640 --> 01:25:34,640
One singular sensation.

1895
01:25:34,640 --> 01:25:38,640
Every little move he makes.

1896
01:25:38,640 --> 01:25:48,640
Earth versus Nougat.

1897
01:25:51,640 --> 01:25:53,640
Olly-gomath.

1898
01:25:53,640 --> 01:25:56,640
Get those kids out of there.

1899
01:25:56,640 --> 01:25:58,640
Hey.

1900
01:25:58,640 --> 01:26:00,640
It's Saint Elmo's fire.

1901
