You know, first Cat Stevens, now John Parr. You're on thin ice, Cat.

1902
01:26:04,640 --> 01:26:05,640
Sorry.

1903
01:26:05,640 --> 01:26:09,640
I'm a little heavier now. It's kind of hard.

1904
01:26:09,640 --> 01:26:16,640
Nope, this ain't happening. Too much seafood.

1905
01:26:18,640 --> 01:26:21,640
What the hell got into us? I mean, man, I'd ground us.

1906
01:26:21,640 --> 01:26:24,640
I don't understand.

1907
01:26:24,640 --> 01:26:26,640
Why did it destroy the thunder?

1908
01:26:26,640 --> 01:26:28,640
Why?

1909
01:26:28,640 --> 01:26:29,640
Why?

1910
01:26:29,640 --> 01:26:30,640
Why?

1911
01:26:30,640 --> 01:26:34,640
It had to. Because the world wasn't ready to do it.

1912
01:26:34,640 --> 01:26:36,640
The world?

1913
