1914
01:26:38,640 --> 01:26:45,640
The children, all over the world, they did what we did in every country.

1915
01:26:45,640 --> 01:26:49,640
Give me the warheads in Moscow and Prague and London. They're all useless?

1916
01:26:49,640 --> 01:26:50,640
Yes.

1917
01:26:50,640 --> 01:26:55,640
But they overlooked Canada, and Canada takes over the world. Mandatory tukes and backbaking.

1918
01:26:55,640 --> 01:26:56,640
Oh, God.

1919
