I am crashing from a pop tart high.

1923
01:27:04,640 --> 01:27:06,640
I don't know.

1924
01:27:06,640 --> 01:27:11,640
The world is having a second chance.

1925
01:27:11,640 --> 01:27:15,640
So, no military. You guys want to start a band or something?

1926
01:27:15,640 --> 01:27:22,640
Wait till he's out of sight, then load up Thunder or Number Two.

1927
