I wouldn't call it a nuclear bomb, per se.

1944
01:28:29,640 --> 01:28:33,640
It's really more of like a neutron device, you know, when you put...

1945
01:28:33,640 --> 01:28:35,640
What's the big deal, you guys?

1946
01:28:35,640 --> 01:28:38,640
Look, I like to cruise estate sales. I bought it at one of those.

1947
